@startuml
title Confirm registrations across machines - code
package "src/server/workflow" {
  class "repository-names.mjs" as Names <<module>>
  class "record-store-sync.mjs" as Sync <<module>> {
    + syncRecordStoreNow()
  }
}
Names --> Sync : confirms a new registration
Sync ..> Names : keeps the upstream registration
@enduml
